# Sources for searched replies: April 2006 UCI specification https://backscattering.de/chess/uci/
# (info and bestmove), fisher-2aj rules 1, 7 and 10, and python-chess 1.11.2
# for the independently checked exact values. Written 2026-11-23.
# UCI position and go. Play this transcript in two fresh processes.
> position fen 7k/8/8/8/8/8/8/K7 w - - 0 1
> go
# Rules 2, 5, 7 and 10. There is no capture within four plies. All moves score 0.
# Python-chess counts 3, 9, 54 and 324 nodes at plies 1 to 4.
< info depth 4 score cp 0 nodes 390
# UCI bestmove and rule 6. Both processes must pick the same legal move.
< bestmove {legal}
# UCI quit.
> quit
! exit
